## Stray global-state planted by a run with a bogus HOME/USERPROFILE
## (issue #26: Windows config paths). Zay's global tree belongs under
## %APPDATA%\zay — never under the repo. If this reappears, the home
## resolution regressed.
AppData/
## Stray POSIX-layout global config planted by a pre-#26 Windows run
.config/

